  "summary": "依次给 n 个人一、二、三……颗糖，循环到第一人；若剩余不足当前应给数量则给完，返回每人所得。",
  "insight": "按发放轮次模拟即可；每轮给 min(remaining,give)，接收人是轮次模人数，然后递增应给数。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "最后一次可能少于应给数量",
    "人数循环但赠送量持续递增",
    "糖果为零后立即停止"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "cyclic-increasing-gift-simulation",
      "title": "循环递增发放模拟",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "按题目顺序逐次扣减剩余糖果。",
      "steps": [
        "answer[n] 全零，give=1,index=0",
        "while candies>0：amount=min(candies,give)，answer[index%n]+=amount，candies-=amount",
        "give++、index++，返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(sqrt(candies))",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/cyclic-increasing-gift-simulation/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/cyclic-increasing-gift-simulation/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/cyclic-increasing-gift-simulation/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
